  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture sector roadmap Southwest Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The roadmap is part of the combi-track activities around the horticulture sector of the Netherlands embassy in Abuja, Nigeria.It aims to generate a clear overview of the horticultural sector in six states in the Southwest of Nigeria: Ekiti, Lagos, Ogun, Ondo, Osun and Oyo.The roadmap looks at the current product flows, the stakeholders and its challenges and it states scenarios for future investment opportunities within the sector. This includes opportunities for the Netherlands embassy, as well as for other donors and co-funding possibilities.The overarching objective of the roadmap, as well as other related horticulture projects, is devising pathways for local and regional stakeholders to strengthening the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
